    <h2 class="project-title">
        Project - Nā
    </h2>


    <p>
        Inspired by the Nā Tree, Sri Lanka’s National Tree this creation blends heritage, nature, and contemporary masculine elegance.
    </p>


    <p>
        Handwoven raw fabric forms the sarong and shirt, enriched with traditional pintuck detailing, gathered fabric and hand-painted Nā flowers and branches by a traditional artist. Patterned stitching, traditional Sri Lankan jewellery, and bespoke brass ornaments complete the ensemble.
    </p>


    <p>
        The signature Nā flower brass ornaments, handcrafted exclusively by Kuwalya, bring a distinctive expression of Sri Lankan identity to the design.
    </p>


    <p>
        A refined celebration of indigenous craftsmanship reimagined through contemporary fashion.
    </p>


